Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.27,0:00:15.94,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}あんなにもたくさんの夏を繰り返してきて
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.94,0:00:20.29,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}たくさんの思い出と  大切な気持ちをもらったのに
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.29,0:00:23.83,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}すべてが… おぼろげになっていく
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.04,0:00:28.30,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}だけど  誰かが背中を支えてくれた
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.47,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}手を引いてくれた
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.72,0:00:36.54,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,500)}失ったはずの体が  さまざまな記憶で補われていくようだった
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.23,0:00:43.02,Text CN - Umi,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnAozora Mincho Medium\fs44\fsp1\pos(960,594)\b0\fad(500,1000)}そして  どの記憶も  まるで祈りかのようで
Comment: 6,0:02:18.00,0:02:18.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文  OP后————————
Dialogue: 6,0:00:49.50,0:00:51.45,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好… 好痒…
Dialogue: 6,0:00:51.78,0:00:52.98,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不… 好痛…
Dialogue: 6,0:00:52.98,0:00:54.36,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真的好痛…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.64,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,鸡窝?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:03.30,0:01:04.65,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你叫醒我的吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.22,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.38,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,谢谢你  凯瑟琳
Dialogue: 6,0:01:09.01,0:01:09.60,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 6,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:20.53,0:01:21.44,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,请问…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这里是哪里
Dialogue: 6,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.24,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我又是谁呢?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:29.82,0:01:32.99,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你说自己是谁  从哪里来的
Dialogue: 6,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.49,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,全都不记得了?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:35.78,0:01:36.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,快过来打招呼
Dialogue: 6,0:01:45.07,0:01:46.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你  你好
Dialogue: 6,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,喂  白羽!
Dialogue: 6,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.09,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她叫白羽吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:01:52.30,0:01:52.97,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 6,0:01:53.43,0:01:57.09,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,然后我是鸣濑… 小鸠
Dialogue: 6,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.06,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鸠先生…
Dialogue: 6,0:01:59.58,0:02:04.72,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,要是失忆了  那就得去内陆的专科医院看病
Dialogue: 6,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.18,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,吃完午饭后  我会安排你过去
Dialogue: 6,0:02:08.77,0:02:09.90,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 6,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.40,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 6,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.06,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:30.98,0:02:34.13,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,为 为 为 为什么… 会知道我的名字
Dialogue: 6,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.92,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不 那个  刚刚你爸爸说的…
Dialogue: 6,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.72,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,爸爸… 不在了
Dialogue: 6,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.39,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,已经死了
Dialogue: 6,0:02:49.36,0:02:51.65,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,喂  你怎么把她弄哭了
Dialogue: 6,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.40,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 6,0:02:53.61,0:02:55.46,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,等… 爸爸!?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.28,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你不是已经死了吗
Dialogue: 6,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我是她的外公啊
Dialogue: 6,0:02:59.87,0:03:01.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,一看就知道了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:03:02.27,0:03:05.12,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好了  快趁热吃吧
Dialogue: 6,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.04,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 6,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.38,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 6,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.50,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,很好吃呢  这个炸鸡块
Dialogue: 6,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.51,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,嗯  毕竟是今早刚宰的鸡
Dialogue: 6,0:03:24.11,0:03:25.60,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这可真新鲜呢
Dialogue: 6,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.82,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳——!?
Dialogue: 6,0:03:35.93,0:03:37.36,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,没忘带东西吧
Dialogue: 6,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.16,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:03:42.62,0:03:43.49,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽!
Dialogue: 6,0:03:46.68,0:03:47.91,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,刚刚非常抱歉
Dialogue: 6,0:03:48.18,0:03:48.66,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:03:49.22,0:03:49.96,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 6,0:03:50.26,0:03:51.53,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:03:51.53,0:03:53.45,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我太没神经了
Dialogue: 6,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.63,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,没神经?
Dialogue: 6,0:03:56.17,0:04:00.36,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,怎么说呢… 对  就是太神经大条了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:00.36,0:04:01.60,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,神经大条?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.14,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太大意了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.10,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,大意?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.64,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不  那个  也就是…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.18,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你的语文课上完了吗
Dialogue: 6,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,啊  上完了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:11.93,0:04:12.69,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 6,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.16,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 6,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.76,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:29.25,0:04:31.50,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,就算问我为什么…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.54,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她害怕坐船
Dialogue: 6,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.51,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,准备登船时  望了一眼大海
Dialogue: 6,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.59,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不知为何  身体动不了了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.68,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,唉  太不好意思了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.72,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:44.01,0:04:45.44,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,大意了吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.17,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个… 有点不太一样?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.57,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,不一样吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:49.57,0:04:51.35,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,大意好难啊
Dialogue: 6,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.68,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉  不小心就…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:55.76,0:04:58.23,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,那样就是  神经大条
Dialogue: 6,0:04:59.34,0:05:00.24,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 6,0:05:00.74,0:05:04.86,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,于是  我决定让她暂住在我们家
Dialogue: 6,0:05:05.72,0:05:06.32,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,请问…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.33,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真的可以吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.29,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这个家里只有我和她两个人
Dialogue: 6,0:05:13.88,0:05:16.42,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我要去工作  所以不常在家
Dialogue: 6,0:05:17.00,0:05:20.34,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,让你住在这里  也算不上啥坏事吧
Dialogue: 6,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.13,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但有一件事
Dialogue: 6,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.22,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,别跟她提有关父母的事
Dialogue: 6,0:05:25.98,0:05:30.89,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,特别是她母亲的事  希望你千万别提起
Dialogue: 6,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.35,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,难道说她妈妈也?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:34.10,0:05:38.07,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,一个月前  那孩子的父亲因事故去世了
Dialogue: 6,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.57,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,在那不久后  白羽的母亲…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:42.12,0:05:44.96,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,也就是我的女儿  也跟着消失了
Dialogue: 6,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她同时失去父母  仅才过去一个月
Dialogue: 6,0:05:50.87,0:05:55.54,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,在你看来  她或许是个很难相处的孩子  但实则很了不起
Dialogue: 6,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.17,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,即便在我面前  也几乎没哭过
Dialogue: 6,0:05:59.80,0:06:04.16,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不… 或许是她实在过于悲伤
Dialogue: 6,0:06:04.16,0:06:07.01,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,所以想哭也哭不出吧
Dialogue: 6,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,先不说那个了  你的名字呢
Dialogue: 6,0:06:12.73,0:06:13.14,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:13.69,0:06:16.52,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,既然一起住  没有名字怎能行
Dialogue: 6,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.44,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,难道什么都想不起来吗
Dialogue: 6,0:06:21.96,0:06:22.78,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,大海…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.20,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七大海洋…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:27.62,0:06:28.33,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:29.15,0:06:32.78,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,脑海中突然浮现了 「七大海洋」这一词
Dialogue: 6,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.37,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,连海都怕的人能想到这个?
Dialogue: 6,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七大海洋…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.87,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海啊…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.17,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:41.99,0:06:42.84,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海
Dialogue: 6,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.63,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,总之  就先这样叫吧
Dialogue: 6,0:06:46.14,0:06:46.70,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好的…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.14,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海…
Dialogue: 6,0:06:54.77,0:06:56.44,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这就是我的名字?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 6,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.92,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,翅膀吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.37,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 6,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.88,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,七海
Dialogue: 6,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.67,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 6,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.55,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,我听说你叫这个名字…
Dialogue: 6,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.42,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,晚饭已经做好了
Dialogue: 6,0:07:33.65,0:07:36.60,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我受鸣濑家照顾已数日
Dialogue: 6,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.35,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,为了找寻记忆  我在岛上四处闲逛
Dialogue: 6,0:07:40.35,0:07:43.32,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但很可惜  并无记忆恢复的迹象
Dialogue: 6,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.12,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鸠先生是一名渔夫
Dialogue: 6,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.69,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽一大早就一个人出去了
Dialogue: 6,0:07:49.69,0:07:53.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,吃完午饭后又一个人出去了  到傍晚才回来
Dialogue: 6,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.79,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,然后这样的日子正在持续着
Dialogue: 6,0:07:57.66,0:07:59.12,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我开动了  我开动了  {\3c&HEB931B&}我开动了
Dialogue: 6,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,哇~ 小鸠先生今天也收获满满啊
Dialogue: 6,0:08:03.73,0:08:08.16,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,每天都能吃到豪华海鲜  白羽想必很开心吧
Dialogue: 6,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.59,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,无论多么新鲜豪华
Dialogue: 6,0:08:14.95,0:08:19.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,每天都吃海鲜刺身  对小孩子来说太平淡无味了
Dialogue: 6,0:08:20.08,0:08:23.48,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,面无表情的吃饭可不行
Dialogue: 6,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.57,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,如果能稍微开心点吃饭就好了
Dialogue: 6,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.28,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好了  完成!
Dialogue: 6,0:08:32.69,0:08:34.99,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,现成食材凑合做的意外不错
Dialogue: 6,0:08:35.66,0:08:40.83,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,话说回来  我明明没有记忆  为何会觉得自己能做出来呢
Dialogue: 6,0:08:40.83,0:08:41.66,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,炒饭?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.87,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,你做了什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.30,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,白羽
Dialogue: 6,0:08:46.34,0:08:47.42,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,做了炒饭哦
Dialogue: 6,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.43,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,你是说烧饭?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.13,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不对  这是炒饭
Dialogue: 6,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.17,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,烧饭?
Dialogue: 6,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.47,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那就折中一下  烧炒饭
Dialogue: 6,0:08:57.83,0:08:58.84,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,烧炒饭!
Dialogue: 6,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.75,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,没错  烧炒饭
Dialogue: 6,0:09:01.08,0:09:01.94,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,烧炒饭!
Dialogue: 6,0:09:02.69,0:09:08.19,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H365136&}烧炒饭！{\3c&HEB931B&}烧炒饭！{\3c&H365136&}烧炒饭！{\3c&HEB931B&}烧炒饭！{\3c&H365136&}烧炒饭！
Dialogue: 6,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.03,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 6,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.36,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 6,0:09:22.75,0:09:27.16,Text CN - Nanami,,0,0,0,,无论多么豪华新鲜  一直吃刺身总会腻的吧
Dialogue: 6,0:09:27.16,0:09:28.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那真不好意思啊
Dialogue: 6,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这是七海做的吗
Dialogue: 6,0:09:33.56,0:09:34.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,是  是的
Dialogue: 6,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.02,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,啊  小鸠先生的份也准备了哦
Dialogue: 6,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.86,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 6,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.32,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不过这个…
Dialogue: 6,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.78,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,怎… 怎么了吗
Dialogue: 6,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.07,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 6,0:09:51.65,0:09:53.66,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,比起那个  真麻烦你了
Dialogue: 6,0:09:54.19,0:09:57.37,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这样啊  七海会做饭啊
Dialogue: 6,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.24,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,可以的话  能为白羽…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不行  七海是客人
Dialogue: 6,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.42,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今后没必要帮做饭
Dialogue: 6,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.84,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,做饭而已  又没什么
Dialogue: 6,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.63,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,多谢款待  我去睡会觉
Dialogue: 6,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.34,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 6,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.39,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,粗茶淡饭不成敬意
Dialogue: 6,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.93,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,这个  很像爸爸的味道
Dialogue: 6,0:10:21.26,0:10:21.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.26,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.77,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,请教我做这个吧!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:27.69,0:10:28.80,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,倒是可以…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.27,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但我也是凭感觉做出来的
Dialogue: 6,0:10:32.94,0:10:37.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,而且你的外公  并不想让我去做饭…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:39.09,0:10:40.99,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,那么  那个啊…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:41.84,0:10:44.58,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,我把我秘密的地方告诉你
Dialogue: 6,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.63,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,秘密的地方?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.71,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,现在不营业了吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:10:52.71,0:10:53.30,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.17,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,爸爸就是在这里做饭的
Dialogue: 6,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.84,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,因为妈妈不太会做饭
Dialogue: 6,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.10,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,所以在帮忙做别的
Dialogue: 6,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.85,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,但是  爸爸出事故死了
Dialogue: 6,0:11:06.22,0:11:08.27,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,妈妈也不见了
Dialogue: 6,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,也不见了…
Dialogue: 6,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.36,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 6,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.44,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,不过大概  是去找爸爸了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.70,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,因为他们的关系非常好
Dialogue: 6,0:11:19.49,0:11:20.64,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽…
Dialogue: 6,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.79,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这样啊  白羽原来每天都会过来打扫
Dialogue: 6,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.46,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,因为妈妈在做这个
Dialogue: 6,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.09,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我也来帮忙吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.06,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.28,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,怎么样啊  白羽
Dialogue: 6,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.74,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯  好吃
Dialogue: 6,0:11:55.05,0:11:56.57,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,味道也一样
Dialogue: 6,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.62,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,不过… 爸爸做的更好吃…
Dialogue: 6,0:12:02.28,0:12:06.02,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,想要完美还原  果然需要菜谱啊
Dialogue: 6,0:12:06.85,0:12:07.83,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,应该有
Dialogue: 6,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.18,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,妈妈写的秘传菜谱
Dialogue: 6,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.47,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这是白羽的…
Dialogue: 6,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.51,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,七海  找到了
Dialogue: 6,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.34,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真的？给我看看给我看看
Dialogue: 6,0:12:24.05,0:12:24.92,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,什么呢什么呢
Dialogue: 6,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.81,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,胡椒  胡萝卜  生菜
Dialogue: 6,0:12:27.81,0:12:28.97,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,河之主?
Dialogue: 6,0:12:29.99,0:12:35.23,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「你有见过吗  那种日落时才会出现的幻之山菜」
Dialogue: 6,0:12:35.69,0:12:39.53,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「山顶涌出的  候鸟喜爱的天然水」
Dialogue: 6,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「候鸟喜爱的凶猛野兽的腐肉」
Dialogue: 6,0:12:43.76,0:12:47.16,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,等一下  怎么有奇怪的材料混入其中了
Dialogue: 6,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.83,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,全都是岛上有的食材
Dialogue: 6,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.88,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,妈妈负责找  爸爸负责做
Dialogue: 6,0:12:53.17,0:12:56.04,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,然后  我也帮妈妈一起找
Dialogue: 6,0:12:56.30,0:12:57.55,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真了不起呢
Dialogue: 6,0:12:57.80,0:13:00.71,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那我现在去找  能帮帮我吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.17,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 6,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,材料都找齐了呢
Dialogue: 6,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,明天再做烧炒饭吧
Dialogue: 6,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.08,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今天辛苦了  白羽
Dialogue: 6,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.86,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我们回来了
Dialogue: 6,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.74,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,看来今天玩得很开心啊
Dialogue: 6,0:14:08.05,0:14:10.49,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,看你们回来时挺高兴的
Dialogue: 6,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.58,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,在岛上跑来跑去  到底在干啥啊
Dialogue: 6,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.54,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,啊… 嘛  干了挺多事
Dialogue: 6,0:14:16.97,0:14:20.25,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对了  我们还见到了小鸠先生的朋友哦
Dialogue: 6,0:14:20.51,0:14:24.13,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我记得是 青龙 朱雀 白虎 玄武先生
Dialogue: 6,0:14:25.79,0:14:26.34,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,慢着!
Dialogue: 6,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.60,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,玄武可是我的称号!
Dialogue: 6,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.59,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个毛头小子!
Dialogue: 6,0:14:32.59,0:14:34.43,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,又擅自冒用我的称号!
Dialogue: 6,0:14:36.42,0:14:40.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海  你常常陪白羽玩  怎么说呢
Dialogue: 6,0:14:41.11,0:14:41.85,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,帮大忙了
Dialogue: 6,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.84,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,哪里哪里  这点小事不算什么
Dialogue: 6,0:14:44.84,0:14:48.53,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但是  我拜托别人调查你的事
Dialogue: 6,0:14:48.53,0:14:50.70,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,结果什么线索都没有
Dialogue: 6,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.06,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,哦  我的记忆
Dialogue: 6,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.58,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,请不要在意
Dialogue: 6,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.87,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你还是多在意在意吧
Dialogue: 6,0:14:58.87,0:15:04.26,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,比起那个  在这岛上  码头附近的坡道前有一家食堂
Dialogue: 6,0:15:05.61,0:15:08.05,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,去岛上的哪里是你们的自由
Dialogue: 6,0:15:08.46,0:15:11.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,唯独那里不行  就算白羽想去也拒绝
Dialogue: 6,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.98,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,因为去那里只会伤心
Dialogue: 6,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.48,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鸠先生…
Dialogue: 6,0:15:16.06,0:15:20.65,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,请问… 白羽的妈妈有什么朋友吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.53,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:15:22.89,0:15:26.86,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,朋友倒是有很多  但关系特别好的是…
Dialogue: 6,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.32,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 6,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.70,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,请问您是加藤… 镜子小姐吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.87,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我就是镜子
Dialogue: 6,0:15:35.54,0:15:38.16,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我记得你是暂住鸣濑家的…
Dialogue: 6,0:15:38.50,0:15:39.36,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我是七海
Dialogue: 6,0:15:39.72,0:15:43.46,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个  我想找您问点关于白羽妈妈的事
Dialogue: 6,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.55,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我也觉得很不可思议
Dialogue: 6,0:15:45.97,0:15:50.35,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她… 瞳居然会把白羽丢下 消失不见
Dialogue: 6,0:15:50.73,0:15:52.93,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她没有来找您说过什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:15:56.52,0:16:01.23,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,说起来  瞳在消失前不久  来找过我问点事
Dialogue: 6,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.28,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那个  问了什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.28,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽的传说
Dialogue: 6,0:16:06.64,0:16:07.10,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.66,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:09.17,0:16:11.13,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这是鸟白岛的传说哦
Dialogue: 6,0:16:11.13,0:16:14.10,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我因为喜欢这些  所以查过资料
Dialogue: 6,0:16:14.10,0:16:15.66,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,是个怎样的传说?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:16.37,0:16:21.12,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,是女人变成一只蝴蝶  去见心爱之人的故事
Dialogue: 6,0:16:21.54,0:16:27.56,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,她跳入大海  将自己的生命献给海神  获得了力量
Dialogue: 6,0:16:27.56,0:16:31.88,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,变成白色羽毛翅膀的蝴蝶  飞向了心爱之人的身边
Dialogue: 6,0:16:32.27,0:16:35.89,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但作为代价  将会失去其他的一切
Dialogue: 6,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.35,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,去见心爱之人…
Dialogue: 6,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.93,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,您跟瞳小姐说了这个?
Dialogue: 6,0:16:41.19,0:16:46.14,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,没错  现在想起来  当时的她或许都想依靠传说了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.51,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,瞳小姐是个怎样的人呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:48.51,0:16:50.82,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,瞳？她很活泼哦
Dialogue: 6,0:16:51.28,0:16:56.58,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,只要有她在的话  无论多么小的事  都会觉得很开心
Dialogue: 6,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.58,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对了对了  还有一句口头禅呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:59.87,0:17:04.44,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我啊  要好好享受当下  可没空怀念过去
Dialogue: 6,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.00,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这么说的
Dialogue: 6,0:17:09.73,0:17:12.68,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,结果什么都不知道啊
Dialogue: 6,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.58,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽的传说… 吗
Dialogue: 6,0:17:21.61,0:17:22.90,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,刚刚的究竟是…
Dialogue: 6,0:17:31.78,0:17:32.52,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,蝴蝶…
Dialogue: 6,0:17:33.24,0:17:36.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你能告诉我一些什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,来  快尝尝吧
Dialogue: 6,0:17:47.66,0:17:48.59,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,好好吃!
Dialogue: 6,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.00,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,是爸爸的味道
Dialogue: 6,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.18,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 6,0:17:54.84,0:17:55.93,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽?
Dialogue: 6,0:17:57.10,0:17:59.68,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,对不起… 但还是不对
Dialogue: 6,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.39,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,虽然非常非常接近了
Dialogue: 6,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.90,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,可我是按菜谱来的
Dialogue: 6,0:18:06.52,0:18:09.12,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你知道具体少了什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.15,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.60,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,要更甜一点
Dialogue: 6,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.03,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,更甜一点吗
Dialogue: 6,0:18:14.24,0:18:18.07,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽  你爸爸做的时候  有放什么吗
Dialogue: 6,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.30,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:19.71,0:18:23.20,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,对了！最后放了黑黑细细的东西
Dialogue: 6,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.26,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,黑黑细细的…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:25.80,0:18:26.77,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,芝麻吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.32,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,不是芝麻
Dialogue: 6,0:18:28.75,0:18:29.92,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这样吗…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:30.29,0:18:34.13,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但是  菜谱没写其他东西了…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:35.18,0:18:35.93,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.93,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,发电厂?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.63,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你居然知道呢
Dialogue: 6,0:18:39.63,0:18:44.42,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但这上面的标志更像是… 太阳吧?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.19,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,太阳要怎么放进去?
Dialogue: 6,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.82,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 6,0:18:48.82,0:18:51.90,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不过  这一定是材料的线索
Dialogue: 6,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.40,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,于是呢
Dialogue: 6,0:18:54.11,0:18:56.62,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,出发寻找太阳吧!
Dialogue: 6,0:18:57.06,0:18:58.53,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,哦——!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:24.63,0:19:27.89,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,去了一些距离太阳较近的地方
Dialogue: 6,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.27,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但没找到材料之类的东西啊
Dialogue: 6,0:19:30.56,0:19:31.22,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 6,0:19:32.57,0:19:33.74,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,啊~ 白羽!
Dialogue: 6,0:19:38.03,0:19:39.58,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 6,0:19:39.58,0:19:40.36,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,还好吗
Dialogue: 6,0:19:40.66,0:19:44.49,Text CN - Ai,蓝,0,0,0,,放暑假之后就没见过面了  有点寂寞呢
Dialogue: 6,0:19:45.65,0:19:49.14,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对了  我有件事想问问你们
Dialogue: 6,0:19:50.27,0:19:53.87,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,这座岛上和太阳有关的地方?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:55.47,0:19:56.75,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,小蓝你知道吗?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.90,Text CN - Ai,蓝,0,0,0,,小苍就是我的太阳
Dialogue: 6,0:19:58.90,0:19:59.51,Text CN - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 6,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.72,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太阳…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.22,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太阳…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:02.81,0:20:07.19,Text CN - Miki,美希,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4C9F44&}说起来  之前白羽同学  不是说过类似的话吗
Dialogue: 6,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.89,Text CN - Miki,美希,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4C9F44&}我记得是  太阳公公之类的
Dialogue: 6,0:20:11.54,0:20:12.74,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.03,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,有想到什么了吗
Dialogue: 6,0:20:14.61,0:20:17.23,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,我好像去过
Dialogue: 6,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.02,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 6,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.30,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.29,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太阳原来是这个啊
Dialogue: 6,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.46,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,把这个捣碎了后
Dialogue: 6,0:20:33.40,0:20:35.26,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,嗯  有点甜味
Dialogue: 6,0:20:35.84,0:20:37.47,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,找到了哦  白羽
Dialogue: 6,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.26,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,你记忆中烧炒饭的最后材料
Dialogue: 6,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.39,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,这里我第一次来
Dialogue: 6,0:20:43.52,0:20:44.93,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,不是说之前来过…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:46.31,0:20:50.81,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,妈妈不见之后  这里是… 我第一次来…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.52,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.72,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,好想回去…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.54,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,回到一年前…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:58.17,0:20:59.44,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,真的好想回去
Dialogue: 6,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.68,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,因为… 都在啊
Dialogue: 6,0:21:02.68,0:21:07.12,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,在这里… 我骑在妈妈的背上…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:07.89,0:21:11.48,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,回到店里… 爸爸来做饭…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.44,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,三个人一起吃…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.26,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,好幸福好温暖…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.12,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,但是… 不在了…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.72,Text CN - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,今年都不在了…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:29.08,0:21:32.23,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我想为白羽找回想要的东西
Dialogue: 6,0:21:33.27,0:21:36.73,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,但白羽真正想要的事物  早就已经…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.11,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我还记得
Dialogue: 6,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.61,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我曾经也和某个人  像这样抬头望着盛开的巨花
Dialogue: 6,0:21:48.34,0:21:51.04,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,可我… 却想不起来…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:52.17,0:21:52.88,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 6,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.71,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,对不起啊
Dialogue: 6,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.76,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,让白羽体验了这份和我相同的心情
Dialogue: 6,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.70,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,所以至少…
Dialogue: 6,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.27,Text CN - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,我还在的时间里  要让白羽展露笑容!
Comment: 5,0:02:18.00,0:02:18.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文JP  OP后————————
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.50,0:00:51.45,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ちょ　くすぐったい…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.78,0:00:52.98,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや　痛い
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.98,0:00:54.36,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,痛いから…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.64,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,鶏小屋？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.30,0:01:04.65,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,起こしてくれたの？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.22,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ええと…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.38,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ありがとう　キャサリン
Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.01,0:01:09.60,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あぁ
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕は…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.53,0:01:21.44,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ここはどこで
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.24,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕は誰でしょうか？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:29.82,0:01:32.99,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,自分が誰で　どこから来たか…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.49,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,まったく覚えていないだと
Dialogue: 5,0:01:35.78,0:01:36.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,はい…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,挨拶をしなさい
Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.07,0:01:46.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,こ　こんにちは？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,これ　しろは！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.09,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃんですか
Dialogue: 5,0:01:52.30,0:01:52.97,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あぁ
Dialogue: 5,0:01:53.43,0:01:57.09,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そしてわしは鳴瀬…　小鳩だ
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.06,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鳩さん…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.58,0:02:04.72,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,記憶喪失というのなら　本土の専門的な病院でしっかり診てもらえ
Dialogue: 5,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.18,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,飯を食べたら　行けるよう手配してやろう
Dialogue: 5,0:02:08.77,0:02:09.90,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,すみません
Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.40,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ありがとう…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.06,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん？
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.98,0:02:34.13,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,な　な　な　なんで…　名前知ってるの…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.92,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや　さっき　お父さんが…
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.72,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お父さんは…　いない
Dialogue: 5,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.39,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,死んだから…！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:49.36,0:02:51.65,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,こら　何を泣かせていた
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.40,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,すみません
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.61,0:02:55.46,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,って　お父さん!?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.28,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あなたは死んでるはずじゃあ…！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わしはあの子の祖父だ
Dialogue: 5,0:02:59.87,0:03:01.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,見たらわかるだろうが
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.27,0:03:05.12,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ほれ　あったかいうちに食べてしまえ
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.04,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.38,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いただきます
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.50,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,おいしいですね　このから揚げ
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.51,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あぁ　今朝しめたばかりのやつだからな
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.11,0:03:25.60,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それは新鮮です
Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.82,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,キャサリーン!?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.93,0:03:37.36,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,忘れ物はないか？
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.16,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ええと…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.62,0:03:43.49,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.68,0:03:47.91,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,さっきはごめん
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.18,0:03:48.66,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.22,0:03:49.96,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,なんで
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.26,0:03:51.53,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,その…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.53,0:03:53.45,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,デリカシーがなかったから
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.63,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,デリカシー？
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.17,0:04:00.36,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なんて言うか…　そう　無神経だった
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.36,0:04:01.60,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,無神経？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.14,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うかつだった
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.10,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うかつ？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.64,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや　あの　つまり…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.18,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,国語の授業はもうええかの
Dialogue: 5,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,は　はい
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.93,0:04:12.69,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,じゃあね
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.16,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,じゃあね
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.76,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,なにゆえ…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.25,0:04:31.50,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なにゆえと言われましても…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.54,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,船が怖いそうだ
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.51,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,船に乗ろうとして海を見たら
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.59,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なぜかその場から動けなくなって…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.68,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いやぁ　お恥ずかしい…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.72,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,まったくだ…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.01,0:04:45.44,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うかつだった？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.44,0:04:48.17,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それは…　ちょっと違う？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.57,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,違うの？
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.57,0:04:51.35,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うかつは難しい…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.68,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あっ　ごめん　つい…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.76,0:04:58.23,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,そういうの無神経
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.34,0:05:00.24,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,だよね
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.74,0:05:04.86,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そういうわけで　しばらくこいつをうちで預かることにした
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.72,0:05:06.32,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ふえ？
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.33,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,本当にいいんですか？
Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.29,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,この家はわしとあの子の2人だけ
Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.88,0:05:16.42,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わしは仕事で家を空けることが多い
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.00,0:05:20.34,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あんたがいてくれるのは　そう悪いことじゃない
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.13,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,だが　1つだけ
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.22,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの子の前で親の話…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:25.98,0:05:30.89,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,特に母親の話を持ち出すのだけは　やめてもらいたい
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.35,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,もしかしてお母さんも？
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.10,0:05:38.07,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,1か月前　あの子の父親が事故で亡くなった
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.57,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それからほどなくしろはの母親…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.12,0:05:44.96,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わしの娘が　姿を消した
Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.57,0:05:49.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,両親が一度にいなくなり　まだ1か月
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.87,0:05:55.54,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,お前には難しい子に見えるかもしれないが　立派な子だ
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.17,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わしの前でもほとんど泣いたりしない
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.80,0:06:04.16,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや…　あるいは度が過ぎた悲しみの前には
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.16,0:06:07.01,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,人は泣くこともできないのかもしれないな
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それはそれとして　お前の名前だ
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.73,0:06:13.14,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.69,0:06:16.52,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,一緒に住む以上　ないと困るだろう
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.44,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,何か思い出したりしないのか？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.96,0:06:22.78,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,海…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.20,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七つの海…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.62,0:06:28.33,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,どうした？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.15,0:06:32.78,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,頭に浮かんだんです…　「七つの海」って
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.37,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,海にも出られないやつがか？
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七つの海…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.87,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海か…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.17,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ななみ…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.99,0:06:42.84,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海
Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.63,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,とりあえず　そうしておくか
Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.14,0:06:46.70,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,はい…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.14,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ななみ…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.77,0:06:56.44,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それが僕の名前？
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,これは…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.92,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,羽　かな？
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.37,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,チョウ？
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.88,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,七海
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.67,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.55,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,そういう名前だって聞いたから…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.42,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ごはんができたって
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.65,0:07:36.60,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,鳴瀬家のお世話になり 早数日
Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.35,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕は記憶を求めて　島内を散策したが
Dialogue: 5,0:07:40.35,0:07:43.32,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あいにくと　記憶が戻る気配はなかった
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.12,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鳩さんは漁師の仕事
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.69,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃんは朝から1人で出かけて
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.69,0:07:53.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,お昼ごはんを食べたら夕方までまた1人でどこかに行く
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.79,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そして　そんな日々が続くなか…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.66,0:07:59.12,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いただきます　 いただきます　 {\3c&HEB931B&}いただきます
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わ～　小鳩さん今日も大漁だ～
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.73,0:08:08.16,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,毎日 豪華海鮮なんて　うれしいねしろはちゃん
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.59,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いくら新鮮で豪華でも
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.95,0:08:19.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,毎日お刺身っていうのは　子どもにはやっぱりちょっとつらいよ
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.08,0:08:23.48,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの無表情な食事…　あれはよくない
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.57,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ちょっとは食事を楽しんでくれるといいんだけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.28,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,よし　完成！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.69,0:08:34.99,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あり合わせにしてはいい感じ
Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.66,0:08:40.83,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,というか　記憶がないのになんで作れるなんて思ったんだろう
Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.83,0:08:41.66,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,チャーハン？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.87,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,なに作ったの？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.30,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.34,0:08:47.42,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,チャーハンだよ
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.43,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,焼き飯のこと？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.13,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,違うよ　チャーハン
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.17,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,焼き飯？
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.47,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,じゃあ間を取って　やーはん
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.83,0:08:58.84,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,やーはん！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.75,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そう　やーはん
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.08,0:09:01.94,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,やーはん！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.69,0:09:08.19,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H365136&}やーはん！　{\3c&HEB931B&}やーはん！　{\3c&H365136&}やーはん！　{\3c&HEB931B&}やーはん！　{\3c&H365136&}やーはん！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.03,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,おいしい
Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.36,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.75,0:09:27.16,Text JP - Nanami,,0,0,0,,いくら豪華で新鮮でも　お刺身ばかりだと飽きるよね
Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.16,0:09:28.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それは悪かったな
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海が作ったのか
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.56,0:09:34.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,は　はい
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.02,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あっ　小鳩さんの分もありますよ
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.86,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うまい
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.32,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しかしこれは…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.78,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ど　どうかしましたか？
Dialogue: 5,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.07,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.65,0:09:53.66,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それよりも　世話をかけた
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.19,0:09:57.37,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうか　七海は料理ができるのか
Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.24,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,よかったら　しろはのために…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いや　七海は客人だ　
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.42,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今後 料理などする必要はない
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.84,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,別に料理くらい…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.63,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ごちそうになった　わしは少し寝る
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.34,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ごちそうさま
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.39,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うん　お粗末さま
Dialogue: 5,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.93,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,これ　お父さんの味に似てる
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.26,0:10:21.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.26,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.77,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,作り方　教えてほしい！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.69,0:10:28.80,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いいけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.27,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,でも　僕も感覚で作っただけだし…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.94,0:10:37.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それにおじいさん　僕が料理するのよく思ってないみたいだし…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.09,0:10:40.99,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,じゃあ　あのね
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.84,0:10:44.58,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,私の秘密の場所も教えてあげる
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.63,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,秘密の場所？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.71,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今はやってないの？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.71,0:10:53.30,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.17,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ここでお父さんが作ってたの
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.52,0:10:59.84,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんは　あんまり料理できなくて…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.10,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,それ以外のこと手伝っていたの
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.85,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,けど　お父さんは事故で死んじゃった
Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.22,0:11:08.27,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんもどこかに行った
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,どこかって…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.36,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,わからない
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.44,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,でもたぶん　お父さんを探しにいったの
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.70,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,とても仲よしだったから
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.49,0:11:20.64,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.79,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうか　しろはちゃん毎日掃除しにきてたんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.46,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんがやってたから…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.09,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕も手伝うよ
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.06,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.28,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,どうかな　しろはちゃん
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.74,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,んっ　おいしい
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.05,0:11:56.57,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,味付けもそっくり
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.62,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,でも…　お父さんが作ったのはもっとおいしかった…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.28,0:12:06.02,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,やっぱり完全に再現するには　レシピが必要かぁ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.85,0:12:07.83,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,あったはず
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.18,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんが書いた秘伝のレシピ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.47,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,これはしろはちゃんの…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.51,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,七海　あったよ
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.34,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ホント？　見せて見せて
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.05,0:12:24.92,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なになに？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.81,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,胡椒　人参　レタス
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.81,0:12:28.97,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,河の主？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.99,0:12:35.23,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「君は見たことがあるか　日没の頃だけに現れる幻の山菜」
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.69,0:12:39.53,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「山の頂にわき出る　渡り鳥が愛した天然水」
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,「渡り鳥が愛した猛々しき獣の死肉」
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.76,0:12:47.16,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ちょっと待って　なんか謎の材料が混じってるけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.83,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,全部　この島にある食材
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.88,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんが集めて　お父さんが作るの
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.17,0:12:56.04,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,で　私も一緒にお母さん手伝った
Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.30,0:12:57.55,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,偉いね
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.80,0:13:00.71,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,じゃあ　今から探しに行くから　手伝ってくれる？
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.17,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うん！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,材料そろったね
Dialogue: 5,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,やーはんの試作は明日かな
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.08,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今日はお疲れさま　しろはちゃん
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.86,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ただいま戻りました～
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.74,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,よほど楽しかったのだろうな
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.05,0:14:10.49,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うれしそうな顔をしていた
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.58,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いったい　島を回って何していたんだ？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.54,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あぁ…　まぁ　いろいろと
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.97,0:14:20.25,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうだ　小鳩さんのお友達にも会いましたよ
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.51,0:14:24.13,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,たしか　青龍　朱雀　白虎　玄武さん
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.79,0:14:26.34,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,待て
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.60,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,玄武はわしの称号だぞ！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.59,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,おのれ あの青二才
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.59,0:14:34.43,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,また勝手に名乗りおって！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.42,0:14:40.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海よ　しろはとよく遊んでくれてなんというか…
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.11,0:14:41.85,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,助かる
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.84,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,いえいえ　これくらいなんてこと
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.84,0:14:48.53,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,だが　お前のことはいろいろ調べているが
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.53,0:14:50.70,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,何も手がかりはないというのに…
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.06,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あぁ　僕の記憶！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.58,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,気にしないでください
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.87,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,お前は気にしろ
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.87,0:15:04.26,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,それよりもこの島だが　港近くの坂道の手前に食堂があってな
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.61,0:15:08.05,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,島のどこに行くのも自由だが
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.46,0:15:11.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そこだけはしろはが行きたがっても　断ってくれ
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.98,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,悲しい思いをするからな
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.48,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,小鳩さん…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.06,0:15:20.65,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの…　しろはちゃんのお母さんは友達とかいなかったんですか？
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.53,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうだな
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.89,0:15:26.86,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,友達はたくさんいたが　特に仲がよかったのは…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.32,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,は～い
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.70,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,加藤…　鏡子さんでしょうか？
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.87,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,鏡子は私だけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.54,0:15:38.16,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あなたはたしか　鳴瀬さんのところの
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.50,0:15:39.36,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,七海です
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.72,0:15:43.46,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,その　しろはちゃんのお母さんのことでお話が
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.55,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,私も不思議なの
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.97,0:15:50.35,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの子…　瞳が　しろはちゃんを置いていなくなるなんて
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.73,0:15:52.93,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,何も相談とかなかったんですか？
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.52,0:16:01.23,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そういえば　瞳がいなくなる少し前　話を聞きにきたわ
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.28,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,あの　話とは!?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.28,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽の伝承
Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.64,0:16:07.10,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うん？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.66,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはね？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.17,0:16:11.13,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,鳥白島の伝承よ
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.13,0:16:14.10,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,私はそういうのが好きで　調べているの
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.10,0:16:15.66,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,どういった話なんですか？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.37,0:16:21.12,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,女の人が蝶になって　愛する人に会いにいくお話ね
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.54,0:16:27.56,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,彼女は海に身を投げ　海の神様に命を捧げることで　力を得て
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.56,0:16:31.88,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白い羽の蝶になり　愛する人のもとへ飛んでいく
Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.27,0:16:35.89,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,けれど　代わりに他のすべてを失ってしまう…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.35,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,愛する人のもと…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.93,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,その話を瞳さんに？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.19,0:16:46.14,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,えぇ　今思えば　伝承にでもすがりたかったのかもしれない…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.51,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,瞳さんはどんな人だったんですか？
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.51,0:16:50.82,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,瞳？　パワフルだったよ
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.28,0:16:56.58,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,彼女がいると　どんな小さなことも　すっごく楽しいことに思えたわ
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.58,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうそう　口癖みたいに言ってたっけ
Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.87,0:17:04.44,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,私はね　過去を懐かしむ暇もないくらい　今を楽しむんだ！
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.00,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,って
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.73,0:17:12.68,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,結局 何もわからずじまいかぁ…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.58,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,白羽の伝承…　か
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.61,0:17:22.90,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,今のはいったい…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.78,0:17:32.52,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,チョウ…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.24,0:17:36.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,君なら　僕に何か教えてくれるの？
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,さぁ　食べてみて
Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.66,0:17:48.59,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,おいしい
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.00,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お父さんの味とそっくり
Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.18,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,じゃあ…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.84,0:17:55.93,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん？
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.10,0:17:59.68,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ごめん…　でも違うの
Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.39,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,すごくすごく近いんだけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.90,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,レシピどおりなんだけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.52,0:18:09.12,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,具体的には何が足りないかわかる？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.12,0:18:10.15,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,えっと…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.60,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,もう少し甘かった
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.03,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,甘いかぁ…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.24,0:18:18.07,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃん　お父さんが作ったとき何か入れてなかった？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.36,0:18:19.30,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ええと…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.71,0:18:23.20,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,そうだ！　黒くて細かいの最後に入れてた
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.26,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,黒くて細かい…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.80,0:18:26.77,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ごま？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.32,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ごまじゃなかった
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.75,0:18:29.92,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そっかぁ…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.29,0:18:34.13,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,でも　レシピにはこれ以上何も書いて…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.18,0:18:35.93,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なんだこれ？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.93,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,発電所？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.63,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,よく知ってるね
Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.63,0:18:44.42,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,でもこれ　どっちかっていうと…　太陽なんじゃないかな
Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.81,0:18:47.19,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,太陽なんかどうやって入れるの？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.82,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,わからない
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.82,0:18:51.90,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,でもきっとこれは　材料の手がかりなんだよ
Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.40,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ってなわけで…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.11,0:18:56.62,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太陽を探しに出発！
Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.06,0:18:58.53,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お～っ！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.63,0:19:27.89,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太陽に近い感じの場所とか行ってみたけど
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.89,0:19:30.27,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,材料っぽいものはなかったね…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.56,0:19:31.22,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.57,0:19:33.74,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,あっ　しろは！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.03,0:19:39.58,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,久しぶり！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.58,0:19:40.36,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,元気？
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.66,0:19:44.49,Text JP - Ai,蓝,0,0,0,,夏休みに入って一度も会えてなかったから　寂しかった
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.65,0:19:49.14,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,そうだ　君たちにちょっと聞きたいんだけど…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.27,0:19:53.87,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,この島で太陽と関係ありそうな場所？
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.47,0:19:56.75,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,藍 知ってる？
Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.90,Text JP - Ai,蓝,0,0,0,,蒼ちゃんが私の太陽
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.90,0:19:59.51,Text JP - Ao,苍,0,0,0,,はえ？
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.72,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太陽…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.22,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太陽…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.81,0:20:07.19,Text JP - Miki,美希,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4C9F44&}そういえば　前にしろはさん　それっぽいこと言ってませんでしたか？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.89,Text JP - Miki,美希,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4C9F44&}たしか　おひさまがどうとか…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.54,0:20:12.74,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,どうしたの？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.03,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,何か思い出した？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.61,0:20:17.23,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,行ったこと　あるかもしれない
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.02,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ホント？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.30,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.29,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,太陽ってそういうことか…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.46,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,これを潰して細かくして…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.40,0:20:35.26,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,うん　ほのかに甘い
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.84,0:20:37.47,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,見つけたよ　しろはちゃん
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.26,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,思い出のやーはんの最後の材料
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.39,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,初めて来た
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.52,0:20:44.93,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,前に来たって…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.31,0:20:50.81,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お母さんがいなくなってから　初めて…　来たの…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.52,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろは…　ちゃん…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.72,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,戻りたい…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.54,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,1年前に…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.17,0:20:59.44,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,戻りたいよ
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.68,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,だって…　いないんだよ
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.68,0:21:07.12,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,ここで　お母さんと…　肩車してくれて…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.89,0:21:11.48,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,お店に戻ったら　お父さんが料理してて…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.44,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,3人で食べて
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.26,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,あったかかった
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.12,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,でも　いない…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.72,Text JP - Shiroha,白羽,0,0,0,,今年はいないの…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.08,0:21:32.23,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,しろはちゃんが望むものを 取り戻したかった…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.27,0:21:36.73,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,でも　本当にしろはちゃんが望むものはもう…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.11,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,覚えている…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.61,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕もいつか誰かと　こうして大きな花を見上げていた
Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.34,0:21:51.04,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,なのに　思い出せない…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.17,0:21:52.88,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ごめん…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.71,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,ごめんね…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.76,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,こんな気持ちをしろはちゃんにもさせてしまったこと…
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.70,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,だからせめて…
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.30,0:22:08.27,Text JP - Nanami,1,0,0,0,,僕がいる間は　しろはちゃんが笑えるようにしてあげたい！
